  {
   "id": "seg-03",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Before I leave, I write a short summary for the team. We discuss the risk around the minimal example. I document the environment details so the team can review it later. I catch an exception and then explain the risk. We decide to handle an error after the review. At the end of the day, Maria says, \"I've already tried that.\" I reply, \"What should I do next?\" I write the steps to reproduce. Now the team can see the bug.",
   "tts": "Before I leave, I write a short summary for the team. We discuss the risk around the minimal example. I document the environment details so the team can review it later. I catch an exception and then explain the risk. We decide to handle an error after the review. At the end of the day, Maria says, \"I've already tried that.\" I reply, \"What should I do next?\" I write the steps to reproduce. Now the team can see the bug.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-03.mp3",
   "zh": "离开前，我给团队写了一份简短的总结。我们讨论了最小示例相关的风险。我把环境详情写成文档，方便团队之后查看。我捕获异常，然后解释了风险。评审之后，我们决定处理错误。一天结束时，Maria说：\"我已经试过那个方法了。\"我回答：\"我下一步应该怎么做？\"我写下了复现步骤。现在团队能看到这个缺陷了。",
